<p>1. taboot par taqi asws. ke zehra ka marsiya hai.</p>

<p>zalim l.a, ne be gunaah ko zehre dagha diya hai.</p>

<p> 2. angoor khake mera bacha tadap raha tha.</p>

<p>zehre dagha se uska tukde jigar hua hai.</p>

<p>3. chat par pada hua tha laasha mere taqi asws. ka.</p>

<p>sab beqabar thi ummat rehbar guzar gaya hai.</p>

<p>4. saansein ukhad rahi hai dadi sa. madad ko aao.</p>

<p>jawad ka wo kehna mujhko rula raha hai.</p>

<p>5. mayyat pe sar barehna qud baap ro raha hai.</p>

<p>allah re taqi asws., ka gham baap ko mila hai.</p>

<p>6. ummul fazal ne maara dhoke se zeher deke.</p>

<p>ghurbat hai yeh taqi asws. ki usko bhi yeh pata hai.</p>